<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News says sells stake in PMP.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News says sells stake in PMP.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Ltd, the Australian arm of Rupert Murdoch's News Corp Ltd, said on Wednesday it has sold its interest in multi-media group PMP Communications Ltd.</p>
</text>
